The test vehicle approaches the intersection at target speed V1. The Pedestrian waiting to cross the crosswalk are positioned on the left/right side of the current lane, with a distance D between them and the centerline of the lane. The pedestrian crossing the crosswalk at speed V2 toward the left/right side of the target lane. During the test vehicle's straight passage through the intersection, the time required for the test vehicle to reach the collision point is identical to the time required for the pedestrian to reach the collision point.